  "worked_solution": "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,4{x}^{2}-5x+2 \\\\  & -{x}^{2}+4x+3\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,-4{x}^{4}+21{x}^{3}-10{x}^{2}+0x+7\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,{\\,\\,-\\,4{x}^{4}+16{x}^{3}+12{x}^{2}}_{\u2015} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,5{x}^{3}-22{x}^{2}+0x+7 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{5{x}^{3}-20{x}^{2}-15x}_{\u2015} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2{x}^{2}+15x+7 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-2{x}^{2}+8x+6}_{\u2015} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,7x+1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n- the quotient is $4{x}^{2}-5x+2,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $7x+1.$",
